<http://example.org/ch15/anchor/15.13.md#%28c%29%20The%20sequence%20%24y_1%2C%20y_2%2C%20%5Cldots%24%20%2C%20is%20unique%2C%20except%20for%20scalar%20factors.> <http://example.org/ch15/file> "15.13.md" .
<http://example.org/ch15/anchor/15.13.md#%28c%29%20The%20sequence%20%24y_1%2C%20y_2%2C%20%5Cldots%24%20%2C%20is%20unique%2C%20except%20for%20scalar%20factors.> <http://example.org/ch15/quote> "(c) The sequence $y_1, y_2, \\ldots$ , is unique, except for scalar factors." .
